//! Optional Vulkan runtime adapter built on `ash`.
//!
//! Code generation is available without this module. Enabling the
//! `vulkan-runtime` feature adds both a low-level adapter for caller-owned Vulkan
//! resources and a correctness-first self-contained execution context. The latter
//! dynamically loads Vulkan, selects a compute queue, creates host-visible storage
//! buffers, submits one-shot command buffers, and waits for completion. It is meant
//! for integration and golden testing; applications can still use
//! [`VulkanComputePipeline`] directly when they own their Vulkan resources.

